      "title": "Image Analysis",
      "summary": "Updated Summary: Assessed messages cover safe promos, recruitment scams, and phishing via fake monetary promises.\n\nKey Details:\n- Suspected Bank Accounts: None\n- Suspicious Phone Numbers: None\n- Scam Tactics: Typosquatted domains (webgocompanyy.com), fake HR interviews, upfront payment requests, and soliciting bank account numbers with promises of cash (e.g., 1000 Ringgit).\n\nRecommendation: Never share bank details or pay upfront fees. Verify recruiters and financial offers independently via official company channels.",
